  "description": "Once known as \u0130ririn or \u00c9r\u00e9rin and now known as Da\u011f\u00f6n\u00fc, this modern Turkish village located in the Van Province of eastern Turkey at the eastern coast of Lake Van lies ca. 10 km north of Ayanis. Here a stela with an inscription of the Urartian king Minua (9th / 8th century BCE) has been found (CTU I A 5-18).",
